			title: "Infectious"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7211E9ED86A677EE"]
			description: ["When first turned, you will be rather weak. At this stage, sunlight will not yet hurt you, and you'll gain a blood bar. The primary way to fill the bar is by drinking blood from mobs, holding the keybind (Default V) while looking at a mob. The symbol over the crosshair can show how much blood a mob has. Exhausting this supply can be fatal to the one drank from. If your blood bar is full, having a blood bottle in your hotbar will fill it when drinking"]
			id: "28751771BB33158E"
			rewards: [{
				id: "181972D4CBDD5BDD"
