			description: [
				"&o&4Faction controlled villages&r are protected and occupied by one of the three factions. While exploring, you may find a village already with a fragile totem. If not, you can make a base and head yourself."
				"When claimed by a faction, all workstations and beds will be claimed by that faction. Right clicking a totem head not belonging to you will start &oa raid&r in which some of the attacking faction will spawn and try to take out the current possessors."
