		{
			dependencies: ["7D9272CEE9C29156"]
			description: ["Once you've become a lord, you can get a minion. &oYou can only have a number of minions equal to your lord level.&r To recruit a minion, find a weak vampire npc and interact with them holding a Vampire Minion Binding. Moon charms are received as rewards for completing the task, &o\"Minion Control.\"&r"]
			id: "0272168A10CD6E01"
