		{
			dependencies: ["143F22ADA2229BF4"]
			description: ["Once you've hit max level at 14, you can start to increase your age rank. You can do this by killing mobs with your bite attack. To check your progress on increasing your rank, interact with a coffin. As your age increases, you get more health, less sun damage, less blood drain, the ability to drain blood from attacks, and faster resurrection. However, you will also take more damage from fire, garlic, holy water, and hunters, as well as having harsher prices from villagers."]
			id: "0CC9087813E5F33E"
